Structural time-series components
--------------------------------
crates/structural-timeseries preserves Rust ports of R bsts 0.9.11 and
BOOM 0.9.16 numerical routines. Copyright Google LLC and Steven L. Scott,
as specified in the source modules. Many BOOM-derived routines are distributed
under LGPL-2.1-or-later; the text is in licenses/bsts-boom/LICENSE.
The Kinderman-Ramage normal generator and gamma/exponential routines in
src/random.rs and src/random/gamma.rs retain GPL-2.0-or-later notices.
The GPL2 text is preserved in licenses/upstream/GPL-2.txt.
The new impact adapter and Hirmos integration use the project's GPL-3.0-or-later
license. Preserved source attribution and reproduction notes accompany the crate.

